-how-to-trick-exploit-a-true-fae-gentry#post1010959\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I recently watched a old Russian Fairy tale film called &quot;Jack Frost&quot; via MST3K and there's one scene where Baba Yaga is about to roast one of the protagonists and the he says &quot;wait wait I don't know how to properly sit on a griddle&quot; and then Baba Yaga stops and tells him how to sit on it and then he uses this to his advantage and throws her into the oven closes it up while throwing her tree hench men out of the door before letting her out.</div> </div> </div> </div>Clear example of exploiting<br /> <br /> <b>Ban: </b>Must teach cooking methods if requested.<br /> <br /> Which is a suitable Ban for a hag that cooks a lot. Baba Yaga is a cannibal horror parody of a grandmother figure, and being required to instruct makes sense from those roots.<br /> <br /> But I run True Fae as Rank 6-10 Ephemeral Entities.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>\u201cYouth ages, immaturity is outgrown, ignorance can be educated, and drunkenness sobered, but stupid lasts forever.\u201d </i>~ <b>Aristophanes</b><br /> <i>&quot;Virescit Vulnere Virtus&quot;</i> ~ <b>Stewart Clan Motto</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Frailty Chronicles</a></span><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">;</a><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Understanding the power of limitations.</a></b></div>","edited":{"userid":3279,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com